"en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:12:32.11+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-7a.45" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:12:46.319+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-7a.46" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:12:51.867+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-7a.47" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:12:55.531+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-7a.48" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:13:00.04+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-7a.49" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:13:03.791+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-12a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:29:28.09+09:00">Why does the record not say “The Pheasant Gate caught fire disastrously, followed by the Twin Towers”? </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-12a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:29:41.221+09:00">To indicate that the disastrous fire started at the Twin Towers </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-12a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:29:54.331+09:00">and avoid listing the more honorable “Pheasant Gate” next to the “disastrous fire” in the record. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-12a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:30:05.387+09:00">That the record first mentions the Pheasant Gate </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-12a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:30:11.387+09:00">is to honor the honorable. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-12a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:30:47.78+09:00">Summer, fifth month, renchen (day 29). </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-12a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:30:57.916+09:00">The Pheasant Gate followed by the Twin Towers caught fire disastrously. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-14a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:34:45.009+09:00">Winter, tenth month. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-14a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:35:00.705+09:00">The Pheasant Gate followed by the Twin Towers were built anew.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-14a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:36:01.431+09:00">To speak of something “new” </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-14a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:36:17.407+09:00">indicates there had been something old.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-14a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:36:29.802+09:00">“To build” means to remake</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-14a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:36:41.656+09:00">and also to increase the original size. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-14a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:36:54.783+09:00">This was improper,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-14a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:37:04.489+09:00">so why does the record place the honorable “Pheasant Gate” next to the expression “built anew”?</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-14a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:37:26.424+09:00">Though the renewal was improper, </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_011-14a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T08:37:34.618+09:00">with regard to its enhanced beauty, it was still acceptable.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-4a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:03.024+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-4a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:06.614+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:09.621+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:13.614+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:18.073+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:22.971+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:26.263+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:30.451+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:34.2+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:37.465+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:41.214+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:44.409+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:47.365+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:50.238+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:54.342+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T21:59:59.05+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.16" generatedBy="hu