p="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:03:08.598+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.65" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:03:11.685+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.66" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:03:15.707+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.67" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:03:18.561+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.68" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:03:23.586+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.69" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:03:27.559+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.71" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:03:31.308+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.72" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:03:34.873+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.73" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:03:38.891+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.74" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:03:41.715+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.75" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:03:45.739+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.76" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:03:49.066+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.77" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:03:53.396+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.78" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:03:56.512+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_012-5a.79" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:04:09.153+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:06:48.531+09:00">Autumn.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:07:00.284+09:00">Inspection at Hong. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:07:09.835+09:00">It was proper.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:07:25.91+09:00">To avail oneself of the autumnal hunt to practice deploying military maneuvers</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:07:38.091+09:00">was one of the great rituals.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:07:49.176+09:00">Cut down the undergrowth to create a protected space;</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:08:07.282+09:00">Erect red standards to create a provisional entryway;</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:08:16.146+09:00">Take coarse cloth and cover wooden blocks to create entryway posts,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:08:32.372+09:00">Those who proceed smoothly will do so with a fistful of space on either side;</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:08:46.292+09:00">But the charioteers who ram the posts will not gain entry!</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:08:59.428+09:00">Chariot upon chariot following tracks in the dust; </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:09:12.208+09:00">Horse upon horse advancing hoof by hoof;</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:09:20.675+09:00">Game in abundance to be caught;</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:09:36.068+09:00">Only when the charioteers do not lose their proper pace</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:09:46.914+09:00">can the archers hit their mark!</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:10:06.372+09:00">Do not pursue those who go beyond the protected space (hunting/battle).</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:10:23.696+09:00">Such is the principle that one does not pursue those who flee.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:10:37.907+09:00">Game with facial wounds must not be used for offerings,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:11:00.437+09:00">unwhole game must not be used for offerings. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:11:11.701+09:00">Even if game is caught in abundance,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:11:20.923+09:00">the Son of Heaven selects only thirty among them. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:11:34.237+09:00">The remaining game is distributed among the numerous rank and file officers for archery practice in the archery hall.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:11:47.643+09:00">Those who shoot and hit the mark,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:11:58.579+09:00">even if they did not acquire game during the hunt,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:12:08.752+09:00">will acquire game.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:12:21.542+09:00">Those who acquired game during the hunt but shoot and fail to hit the mark,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:12:32.8+09:00">will not acquire game.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.29" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:12:45.715+09:00">By this we know: that the ancients honored humaneness and righteousness</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-66a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-10T09:12:51.956+09:00">and scorned bravado and might.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T01:57:45.825+09:00">Summer, fourth month.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T01:57:57.807+09:00">Gongzi Bi of Chu assumed the position of rulership upon returning home from Jin to Chu</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T01:58:12.962+09:00">and assassinated his ruler Qian in Ganxi.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T01:58:24.018+09:00">“From Jin”</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T01:58:41.937+09:00">indicates Jin supported Gongzi Bi in this.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T01:58:56.992+09:00">When somebody “assumes the position of rulership upon returning home” and partakes of an assassination</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T01:59:07.543+09:00">then the record does not say “assumed the position of rulership upon returning home”.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T01:59:26.997+09:00">And so when the record says “assumed the position of rulership upon returning home” it indicates there was no assassination. </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T01:59:42.245+09:00">“Assuming the position of rulership upon returning home” is recorded as a single event</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T01:59:52.802+09:00">and “assassinating” is recorded as a single event.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:03:11.307+09:00">This indicates Bi was not the assassin.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:03:11.475+09:00">indicates Bi was not the assassin.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:03:11.479+09:00">That here the record speaks of the two events sequentially in a single record</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:03:11.475+09:00">That the record is not dated to the day</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:03:11.476+09:00">The assassination of a ruler is dated to the day.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-109a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:03:11.478+09:00">is because the assassination occurred as a consequence of Bi ’s “assuming the position of rulership upon returning home”.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-110a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:03:59.181+09:00">In cases when the record uses wording indicating usurpation (like here by naming Qiji by his name)</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-110a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:04:13.716+09:00">and does not designate the killer as “someone”,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-110a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:04:26.006+09:00">the killing was carried out by assuming the role of a ruler (as Qiji).</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-110a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:05:19.426+09:00">When in records of the execution of assassin (like Bi here in 13.3) wording is used that indicates usurpation (Qiji’s name), then the murder (by Bi in 13.2)</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-110a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:05:26.014+09:00">was not an assassination.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-110a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:05:39.807+09:00">Thus there are four reasons why Bi did not act as an assassin.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-110a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:05:58.778+09:00">The record refers to the one who has taken the state by the state name in the case of an assassination of a ruler.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-110a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:06:09.739+09:00">And so the record “Gongzi Qiji of Chu killed Gongzi Bi”</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-110a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:06:19.77+09:00">indicates Bi was not a usurper</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-110a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:06:39.025+09:00">because the the Chunqiu does not treat someone as a usurper (by using the state as lineage name) if he replaces another usurper (someone of an ambiguous status?),</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-110a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:06:50.799+09:00">and since Qiji orchestrated the entire affair,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_010-110a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:06:58.135+09:00">for this reason he is the true usurper!</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:22:36.692+09:00">Winter,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:22:29.409+09:00">Bo Ji was sent to her marital home in Ji.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:22:52.973+09:00">tenth month.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:23:03.204+09:00">According to the Rites,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:23:15.494+09:00">when reference is made to a woman being married off, it is called gui, meaning “to be sent to her marital home”</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:23:27.265+09:00">and when she returns it is called lai gui meaning “being returned to her natal home.”</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:23:39.462+09:00">This expresses the principle that she follows others.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:23:57.929+09:00">When a woman resides in her natal home,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:24:05.872+09:00">she is governed by her father;</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:24:14.279+09:00">once married,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:24:22.461+09:00">she is governed by her husband;</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:24:38.024+09:00">and after her husband has died,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:24:46.018+09:00">she follows her eldest son.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:24:57.173+09:00">A woman does not act on her own authority,</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:25:03.732+09:00">she must have someone to follow.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:25:39.261+09:00">“Bo Ji went to her marital home in Ji.”</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:25:48.991+09:00">Why does the wording of this record appear as if she acted on her own authority?</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:25:57.183+09:00">The answer is:</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:26:05.38+09:00">she did not act on her own accord.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:26:17.356+09:00">It was our Bo Ji who was sent to her marital home in Ji</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:26:40.941+09:00">and it is for this reason that it was noted.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:26:50.331+09:00">Why does the previous record not state that Ji Liexu was dispatched?</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:27:14.709+09:00">The way in which the ritual of receiving the bride was conducted was meager</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-15a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2025-12-11T02:27:21.663+09:00">and simply not sufficient to report.</seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:04:41.875+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:04:45.21+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:04:47.693+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:04:51.836+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:04:54.788+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:04:57.769+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:05:04.07+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:05:00.582+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:05:07.117+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:05:10.963+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:05:16.564+09:00"> </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:05:21.703+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:05:27.438+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:05:25.025+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:05:31.842+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:05:42.843+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:05:46.879+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:05:50.799+09:00"> </seg><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:05:54.317+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:05:57.741+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:06:00.709+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:06:04.412+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:06:07.354+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:06:10.042+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.29" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:06:13.126+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:06:16.908+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.31" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:06:20.154+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.32" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:06:24.418+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.33" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:06:28.435+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR1e0008_tls_001-4a.34" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#jgentz" modified="2026-04-24T22:06:31.983+09:00"/></p></div></body></text></TEI>